 "text": "On-Line Search Real Estate | The Polk County Courthouse\nSkip to main content Enable accessibility for low vision Open the accessibility menu\nSkip to content\nAbout WordPress\nWordPress.org\nDocumentation\nLearn WordPress\nSupport\nFeedback\nLog In\nSearch\nHome\nCounty Commissioners\nCounty Offices\nAssessor’s Office\nCounty Clerk\nCircuit Clerk\nCollector’s Office\nCounty Coroner\nOffice of Emergency Management\nPolk County Juvenile Office\nProsecuting Attorney\nPublic Administrator\nRecorder of Deeds\nSurveyor\nTreasurer’s Office\nExplore Polk County\nExplore Polk County\nGeographic Information System (GIS mapping)\nPolk County Genealogical Society\nKYOO Radio 99.1\nPermits and Licenses\nNew Residents\nAddress Change\nHelpful Websites\nVoter Registration\nSelect Page\nHome\nCounty Commissioners\nCounty Offices\nAssessor’s Office\nCounty Clerk\nCircuit Clerk\nCollector’s Office\nCounty Coroner\nOffice of Emergency Management\nPolk County Juvenile Office\nProsecuting Attorney\nPublic Administrator\nRecorder of Deeds\nSurveyor\nTreasurer’s Office\nExplore Polk County\nExplore Polk County\nGeographic Information System (GIS mapping)\nPolk County Genealogical Society\nKYOO Radio 99.1\nPermits and Licenses\nNew Residents\nAddress Change\nHelpful Websites\nVoter Registration\nSearch for... Search\nOn-Line Real Estate Search\nATTENTION ALL USERS – SECURITY CREDENTIALS REQUIRED\nWelcome to our online search. Users must sign up in order to access our data.\nWe do offer access to the images as well with a paid subscription. For subscription information and other questions, please contact us at (417) 326 4924.\nThank you for your cooperation and understanding.\nCarol Poindexter, Polk County Recorder of Deeds\nTo log in you must create a Login User Id and password. Indexed Grantor/Grantee data without images is available for general public use. Documents can be searched by book and page, instrument and legal description. Images and the ability to print or down load documents are only available by subscription. Please Contact Lisa with Mobilis technologies LLC at 816-295-1540 for subscription details and prices.\nClick below to get started:\nPolk County Online Real Estate Search\nSearch for:\nAccessibility Policy\nPay Taxes Online\nPolk County Real Estate Search\nPolk County Sheriff’s Office\nOffice of Emergency Management",
